# What never belongs in the server image.
#
# backend/ and frontend/electron are the till — installed on shop PCs, not
# deployed. The dev laptop's database, its backups and every .env are secrets
# or data, and the build outputs are rebuilt inside the image anyway.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/release
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/backups
**/cloud-sync.json
backend
frontend/electron
frontend/build
frontend/public
frontend/test
cloud/test
.git
.claude
*.md
!cloud/README.md
